    "text": "prompt\n\ntopic: three body problem, sophon\n\nA 45° top-down view of a detailed kinetic sculpture on a square dark wood pedestal. The central thematic model or structure is [INSERT KEY THEMATIC ELEMENT/OBJECT/CREATURE], made of [INSERT MATERIAL &amp; TEXTURE], featuring [INSERT SPECIFIC…",
